== sizes (D4 and D3, re-measured at 4e9730a by scratchpad remeasure.py and remeasure_simplify.py;
   batches of planted.yaml, seed 707, criterion max.v0.derived.alpha > 0.23: 130 x 10 s with 58
   failing, 16 x 60 s and 16 x 300 s with 12 each)
Row rules: total = len(svg_bytes) as mc analyze draws it; polygons = the two fill groups' byte spans;
overlays = the figure minus the same figure without failing-run lines (their legend entries included);
rest = total - polygons - overlays. "before" = the same code with ENVELOPE_COLUMNS past every length
(the exact band, as at 8055ce7). Overlay options are overlays-row bytes with the bands reduced; the
simplify option sets path.simplify_threshold = 1.0 inside pinned_style.

